#
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: DRTC Korean Patch\n"
"Language: ko\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " hears something in "
msgstr "는 들었다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " body make a funny snapping sound."
msgstr " 몸에서 뭔가 툭 끊어지는 웃긴 소리를."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " was disappointed with the workout. "
msgstr "은(는) 운동이 실망스러웠다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " will have to push "
msgstr "는 앞으로 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "self more in the future."
msgstr " 자신을 더 몰아붙여야겠다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
" makes a lot of strained grunting noises as that bar gets lifted. What a "
"workout!"
msgstr "는 바벨을 들어 올리며 힘겨운 신음 소리를 잔뜩 낸다. 대단한 운동이다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " attempts to lift the ridiculously overloaded barbell. "
msgstr "은(는) 터무니없이 무거운 바벨을 들어 보려 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tIF THE BAR AIN'T BENDING YOU'RE JUST PRETENDING"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t봉이 안 휘면 그냥 하는 척이다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
" \r\n"
"\t-- Ancient Bodybuilder Wisdom"
msgstr ""
" \r\n"
"\t-- 고대 보디빌더의 지혜"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " lifts it, though "
msgstr "는 들어 올리긴 하지만, "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " eyes almost pop out of "
msgstr " 눈알이 튀어나올 뻔한다. 그것도 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " head."
msgstr " 머리에서."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Trying to lift that was a catastrophically bad idea! "
msgstr "저걸 들려고 한 건 재앙급으로 나쁜 생각이었다! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " feels something in "
msgstr "은(는) 느낀다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " body explode."
msgstr " 몸속에서 뭔가 터지는 걸."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "I.T.B.A.B.Y.J.P."
msgstr "I.T.B.A.B.Y.J.P."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
"There's a fully loaded olympic weight set here. The amount of weight on it "
"can be adjusted down to a less hernia-causing amount."
msgstr "올림픽 역도 세트가 무게까지 꽉 채워져 있다. 탈장이 덜 날 만큼 무게를 줄일 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, olympic weightlifting really isn't designed to work with "
msgstr "안타깝게도 올림픽 역도는 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:60 deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "'s body."
msgstr "의 몸에는 맞지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:63 deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
"With no one nearby to watch out for zombies, it might be dangerous to get a "
"workout in."
msgstr "좀비를 감시해 줄 사람이 근처에 없으니, 운동하다가 위험해질 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " considers taking a break to get some strength training in as "
msgstr "은(는) 지켜 주는 동료가 있으니 잠깐 근력 운동을 할까 고민한다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:65 deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " is guarded."
msgstr "도 안전하다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Lift Light Weight"
msgstr "가볍게 든다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Lift Heavy Weight"
msgstr "무겁게 든다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Lift Massive Weight"
msgstr "어마어마하게 든다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:70 deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Leave it for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " dies on the exercise bike from the sheer exertion."
msgstr "은(는) 실내 자전거를 타다가 너무 무리해서 죽는다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "An hour passed during that exercise session."
msgstr "운동하는 사이 한 시간이 지났다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " had to fend off zombies while cycling. Watch out!"
msgstr "는 자전거를 타며 좀비를 막아야 했다. 조심해!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:84 deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " sets the stationary cycle to "
msgstr "은(는) 실내 자전거를 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "PAVED ROAD ON THE MOON"
msgstr "달 위의 포장도로"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " and starts moving "
msgstr " 모드로 설정하고 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:84 deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " legs."
msgstr " 다리를 움직이기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "It's good exercise for "
msgstr "좋은 운동이 된다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ", due to being very out of shape."
msgstr "에게는. 몸이 많이 망가져 있었으니까."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
"The exercise wasn't really much better than just sitting around in the car."
msgstr "앉아서 차 타고 있는 거랑 별 차이 없는 운동이었다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "UPHILL COUNTRY ROAD"
msgstr "오르막 시골길"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " and starts pumping "
msgstr " 모드로 설정하고 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " manages to pull something in "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " leg! The pain makes "
msgstr " 다리 근육을 삐끗한다! 너무 아파서 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " fall off the bike."
msgstr "는 자전거에서 떨어진다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " didn't even break a sweat! It does nothing for improving "
msgstr "은(는) 땀 한 방울 안 흘렸다! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " fitness."
msgstr " 체력 향상엔 아무 도움이 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " produces a whole river of sweat. What a workout!"
msgstr "는 강물처럼 땀을 쏟는다. 대단한 운동이다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " sets the cycle to "
msgstr "은(는) 자전거를 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "DEATH ROAD TO CANADA"
msgstr "데스 로드 투 캐나다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " and starts straining "
msgstr " 모드로 설정하고 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " legs to their limit."
msgstr " 다리를 한계까지 혹사한다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " truly "
msgstr "는 진정으로 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "FEELS THE BURN!"
msgstr "근육이 불타는 걸 느낀다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " doesn't last long before falling down from exhaustion. "
msgstr "은(는) 얼마 못 가 기진맥진해서 쓰러진다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " gasps and horks up an organ."
msgstr "는 헐떡이다가 장기 하나를 토해 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Cardiovascular Training"
msgstr "유산소 훈련"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
"There's a deluxe UltraMegaFit brand stationary cycle here. Unlike "
"treadmills, this works with the electricity cut off."
msgstr "고급 울트라메가핏 브랜드 실내 자전거가 있다. 러닝머신과 달리 전기가 끊겨도 작동한다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Unfortunately, this device just isn't designed to work with "
msgstr "안타깝게도 이 기구는 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Unfortunately, "
msgstr "안타깝게도, "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " does NOT do cardio!"
msgstr "은(는) 유산소 운동은 절대 안 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " considers taking a break to get some fitness training in as "
msgstr "은(는) 지켜 주는 동료가 있으니 잠깐 체력 운동을 할까 고민한다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Light Exercise"
msgstr "가벼운 운동"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Heavy Exercise"
msgstr "힘든 운동"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "INTENSE EXERCISE"
msgstr "극한 운동"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "The ghost is "
msgstr "유령은 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "VERY SPOOKY"
msgstr "엄청 무섭다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " to "
msgstr " 그 앞에서 덜덜 떠는 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "! It vanishes!"
msgstr "! 유령이 사라진다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid ""
"Talking to a ghost is EXTREMELY spooky and is sure to be a morale hit, in "
"addition to whatever else happens."
msgstr "유령과 대화하는 건 엄청 무서운 일이라, 무슨 일이 일어나든 사기가 떨어질 게 분명하다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "Ignore ghost for now"
msgstr "일단 유령은 무시한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "The Ghost runs away! By that I mean it floats away real fast."
msgstr "유령이 도망친다! 정확히는 엄청 빨리 둥둥 떠서 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " is amused that "
msgstr "은(는) 재밌어한다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " scared a ghost."
msgstr "가 유령을 겁줬다는 게."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid ""
"The Ghost emits steam out of the sides of its head for a second, and then "
msgstr "유령이 잠깐 머리 양옆에서 김을 뿜더니, "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "EXPLODES!"
msgstr "폭발한다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " is hurt, but the blast infuses "
msgstr "은(는) 다쳤지만, 폭발이 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " with mysterious "
msgstr "에게 신비한 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "GHOST ENERGY!"
msgstr "유령 에너지를 불어넣는다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "This ghost rapidly alternates between trying to scare "
msgstr "이 유령은 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid ", and being overwhelmed with shyness."
msgstr "을(를) 겁주려다가 수줍어하기를 정신없이 반복한다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " talks to ghost about shyness"
msgstr "이(가) 유령과 수줍음에 대해 이야기한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " kisses the ghost"
msgstr "이(가) 유령에게 뽀뽀한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "CHOMP CHOMP CHOMP ALL DAY"
msgstr "하루 종일 냠냠냠"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "The Ghost chomps down on "
msgstr "유령이 유령 이빨로 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " with its ghost teeth! The paranormal pain toughens "
msgstr "을(를) 깨문다! 초자연적인 고통이 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " up!"
msgstr "를 단련시킨다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "It's a ghost! It has nice chompers."
msgstr "유령이다! 이빨이 멋지다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " talks to ghost about teeth"
msgstr "이(가) 유령과 이빨에 대해 이야기한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "OF COURSE I'M SASSING YOU! GET SASSED!"
msgstr "당연히 너한테 깐족대는 거지! 깐족거림이나 받아라!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "The Ghost sasses "
msgstr "유령이 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid ", big time!"
msgstr "에게 아주 제대로 깐족댄다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "OF COURSE I'M FLEXING! I LOVE BEING STRONG!"
msgstr "당연히 힘주는 거지! 난 강한 게 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:63 deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "The Ghost curses "
msgstr "유령이 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " ... with strength!"
msgstr "에게 저주를 건다... 근력의 저주를!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "Curse of Sass"
msgstr "깐족의 저주"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid ""
"This ghost looks like it's flexing, or maybe it's making a really sassy "
"gesture? It's hard to tell due to the ghost lacking a corporeal form."
msgstr "이 유령은 힘을 주고 있는 것 같기도 하고, 아주 깐족대는 몸짓 같기도 하다? 유령이 실체가 없어서 구분하기 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " asks ghost if it's flexing"
msgstr "이(가) 유령에게 힘주는 거냐고 묻는다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " asks if it's sassing "
msgstr "이(가) 깐족대는 거냐고 묻는다: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " farts on the ghost."
msgstr "은(는) 유령에게 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " tells the ghost to"
msgstr "은(는) 유령에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " COOL IT."
msgstr " 진정해."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid ""
"I HAVE NEVER HEARD SUCH PERFECTION!\r\n"
"\t\tYOU HAVE LIFTED MY GHOST CURSE! NOW CHOOSE A GHOSTLY REWARD!"
msgstr ""
"이런 완벽한 말은 처음 들어 봐!\r\n"
"\t\t내 유령 저주를 풀어 줬구나! 이제 유령의 보상을 골라라!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid ""
"WHAT? YOU CAN'T TELL ME TO COOL IT!\r\n"
"\t\tY... YOU'RE A NERD!"
msgstr ""
"뭐? 네가 나한테 진정하라고 할 수는 없어!\r\n"
"\t\t너... 너 찐따야!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "The Ghost disappears in an angry little puff of ghost smoke. "
msgstr "유령이 작고 화난 유령 연기를 뿜으며 사라진다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " feels really smug about this."
msgstr "은(는) 이 일로 무척 우쭐하다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "UH, MAYBE YOU SHOULD COOL IT"
msgstr "어, 너야말로 진정하는 게 좋겠는데"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " with the "
msgstr "에게 저주를 건다. 걸린 저주는 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "Curse of Cool It!"
msgstr "'진정해'의 저주!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid "'s personality becomes very annoying!"
msgstr "의 성격이 아주 짜증 나게 바뀐다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid ""
"The ghost keeps waving its tongue around. It already seems like an annoying "
"being."
msgstr "유령이 혀를 계속 날름거린다. 이미 짜증 나는 존재 같다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " tells ghost to 'Cool It'"
msgstr "이(가) 유령에게 '진정해'라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/mansion.df"
msgid " yells at ghost"
msgstr "이(가) 유령에게 소리친다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/beach.df:650
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/beach.df"
msgid "Inspired by Walton-On-The-Naze, England."
msgstr "잉글랜드의 월턴온더네이즈에서 영감을 받았다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/beach.df:691
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/beach.df"
msgid "YIPPEE!"
msgstr "야호!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/hmp.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/hmp.df"
msgid "We need keys to open this."
msgstr "이걸 열려면 열쇠가 필요해."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/hmp.df:435
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/hmp.df"
msgid "CAMERAS DISABLED."
msgstr "카메라 비활성화."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/hmp2.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/hmp2.df"
msgid "We need keys to open this."
msgstr "이걸 열려면 열쇠가 필요해."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/hmp2.df:435
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/hmp2.df"
msgid "CAMERAS DISABLED."
msgstr "카메라 비활성화."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "has an assortment of fiery spells!"
msgstr "은(는) 온갖 불꽃 주문을 쓴다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "can dance on the head of a pin as well."
msgstr "은(는) 바늘 끝 위에서도 춤출 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"is ever so slightly accident-prone, which is not great for an explosives-"
"wielder."
msgstr "은(는) 아주 살짝 사고뭉치다. 폭발물 쓰는 사람한텐 별로 좋지 않다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "is going to have an unpleasant time on the toilet."
msgstr "은(는) 화장실에서 곤란한 시간을 보낼 예정이다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "thinks they're in a Lord Of The Dinks remake."
msgstr "은(는) 자기가 '반지의 얼간이' 리메이크 속에 있다고 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:168
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "doesn't sleep so well due to the glow of their sword."
msgstr "은(는) 자기 검에서 나오는 빛 때문에 잠을 잘 못 잔다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "is really good at tossing grenades."
msgstr "은(는) 수류탄을 정말 잘 던진다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "is something similar to Oda Nobunaga, sometimes scarily so."
msgstr "은(는) 오다 노부나가 비슷한 사람이다. 가끔은 무서울 정도로."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:234
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
" puts the final piece of their armour on, only to find a part of it is "
"REALLY chafing. Deus Vult! "
msgstr "은(는) 갑옷의 마지막 조각을 입었는데, 한 부분이 엄청나게 쓸린다. 데우스 불트! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "Don't let zombies get past your shield!"
msgstr "좀비가 방패를 지나가지 못하게 해라!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
" heaves the katana into their hands. They nearly fall over from the weight. "
"Time to make ZOMBO SALAD!"
msgstr "은(는) 카타나를 두 손에 든다. 무게 때문에 넘어질 뻔한다. 좀보 샐러드를 만들 시간이다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "You can find your samurai sword in the trunk. Make sure to use it!"
msgstr "사무라이 검은 트렁크에 있다. 꼭 써라!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
" becomes one with the way of the marksman, spinning their revolver and tying"
" their coat with pleasure. It's highhhhh nooooon! "
msgstr "은(는) 명사수의 길과 하나가 된다. 리볼버를 돌리고 코트 끈을 흐뭇하게 묶는다. 하아아아이 누우우운이다! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"You can find your MAMBA and SLUG SHOTGUN in the trunk. Make sure to use "
"them!"
msgstr "맘바와 슬러그 산탄총은 트렁크에 있다. 꼭 써라!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
" twirls their bow around in their hands, before nearly dropping the bow on "
"their foot. Go for the eyes! "
msgstr "은(는) 활을 손에서 빙글빙글 돌리다가 발등에 떨어뜨릴 뻔한다. 눈을 노려라! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "Juggle your bow and other weapons where necessary!"
msgstr "필요하면 활과 다른 무기를 번갈아 써라!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:260
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
" silently recites a spell known for GREAT GLUTES under their breath. May "
"your magic be potent, and your spells deadly! "
msgstr "은(는) 숨죽여 '위대한 엉덩이'로 유명한 주문을 외운다. 그대의 마법은 강력하고, 주문은 치명적이기를! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "Get trained up! Your weapons are powerful...but heavy."
msgstr "훈련해서 키워라! 무기는 강력하지만... 무겁다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
" binds their weapon to their patron, who promptly rewards them with a "
"massively inflated ego. Dolor! "
msgstr "은(는) 무기를 후원자에게 묶는다. 후원자는 곧바로 엄청나게 부풀어 오른 자존심을 보상으로 준다. 돌로르! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "You can find your hexblade sword in the trunk. Make sure to use it!"
msgstr "헥스블레이드 검은 트렁크에 있다. 꼭 써라!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:272
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
" tinkers with the fuse of one of their bombs, only to realise it's a DUD. "
"Blow em all to heck! "
msgstr "은(는) 폭탄 하나의 도화선을 만지작거리다가 그게 불발탄이라는 걸 깨닫는다. 다 날려 버려라! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:273
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"Don't be afraid to lob your dynamite everywhere! Your poleaxe is in the "
"trunk."
msgstr "다이너마이트를 사방에 던지는 걸 두려워하지 마라! 폴액스는 트렁크에 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
" excitedly lights a handful of grenades, before realising this is a terrible"
" idea and putting them out. Molon Labe! "
msgstr "은(는) 신나서 수류탄 한 줌에 불을 붙였다가, 이게 끔찍한 생각이라는 걸 깨닫고 끈다. 몰론 라베! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"Get those support stats increased to help your team! Your poleaxe is in the "
"trunk."
msgstr "지원 능력치를 올려서 일행을 도와라! 폴액스는 트렁크에 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "The Melee Class"
msgstr "근접 클래스"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:293
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:314
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:335
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:356
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"You have already picked a class for this character. Since character stats, "
"perks and traits stack with the subclass bonuses, only 1 class is allowed "
"per character per save."
msgstr ""
"이 캐릭터는 이미 클래스를 골랐다. 캐릭터 능력치, 특전, 특성이 서브클래스 보너스와 중첩되기 때문에, 저장마다 캐릭터당 클래스는 하나만"
" 허용된다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"The melee classes are generally tougher and receive bonuses to STR and FIT. "
"They cannot shoot guns. Samurais start with a good sword that can crit, "
"whereas the Knight starts with more health and a shield that can REPEL "
"ZOMBIES in the direction you are facing/moving."
msgstr ""
"근접 클래스는 대체로 튼튼하고 근력과 체력 보너스를 받는다. 총은 쏠 수 없다. 사무라이는 치명타가 나는 좋은 검으로 시작하고, 기사는 "
"체력이 더 많고 바라보거나 움직이는 방향으로 좀비를 밀쳐 내는 방패로 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:299
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:320
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:341
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"Your character's perk and trait setup means they are already complex. Due to"
" this, some features of their perks or traits may be disabled by Archer, "
"Bombardier or Grenadier."
msgstr ""
"이 캐릭터는 특전과 특성 구성이 이미 복잡하다. 그래서 궁수, 폭격수, 척탄병을 고르면 특전이나 특성의 일부 기능이 꺼질 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:302
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "The melee classes have FITNESS as their most important stat."
msgstr "근접 클래스는 체력이 가장 중요한 능력치다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:304
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:325
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:346
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "No, thanks!"
msgstr "됐어요!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:305
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "[Pick The Knight]"
msgstr "[기사 선택]"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "[Pick The Samurai]"
msgstr "[사무라이 선택]"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "The Ranger Class"
msgstr "원거리 클래스"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"The ranged classes are reliable ways to deal with hordes. Marksman is ammo-"
"dependent but powerful, and the only major source of SHOOTING. Archer is "
"only STR/FIT dependent, but limited by their bow."
msgstr ""
"원거리 클래스는 좀비 떼를 상대하는 믿을 만한 방법이다. 명사수는 탄약에 의존하지만 강력하고, 사격 능력치를 올릴 유일한 주요 수단이다."
" 궁수는 근력/체력에만 의존하지만, 활에 제약을 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "The ranged classes have SHOOTING as their most important stat."
msgstr "원거리 클래스는 사격이 가장 중요한 능력치다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:326
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "[Pick The Marksman]"
msgstr "[명사수 선택]"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "[Pick The Archer]"
msgstr "[궁수 선택]"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:331
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "The Mage Class"
msgstr "마법 클래스"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:338
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"Magic classes can obliterate hordes but are fragile. Mages can cast "
"fireballs, or chain deadly damage with scorching ray. Picking mage will "
"likely replace most of your held weapons. Spellblades have excellent stats "
"and even a bit of control, but must remain in melee range."
msgstr ""
"마법 클래스는 좀비 떼를 쓸어버릴 수 있지만 연약하다. 마법사는 파이어볼을 쏘거나, 작열 광선으로 치명적인 연쇄 피해를 줄 수 있다. "
"마법사를 고르면 들고 있는 무기 대부분이 바뀔 가능성이 높다. 마검사는 능력치가 뛰어나고 약간의 제어력도 있지만, 근접 거리에 있어야 "
"한다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "The magic classes have STRENGTH as their most important stat."
msgstr "마법 클래스는 근력이 가장 중요한 능력치다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:347
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "[Pick The Mage]"
msgstr "[마법사 선택]"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:348
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "[Pick The Spellblade]"
msgstr "[마검사 선택]"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "The Bombardier Class"
msgstr "폭격 클래스"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:359
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"The bombardier is a safe but limited explosive option. Bombardier bombs "
"cause no self damage, whereas grenadier grenades are better but have self-"
"damage. Grenadiers receive large bonuses to MED and MECH."
msgstr ""
"폭격수는 안전하지만 제한적인 폭발물 선택지다. 폭격수의 폭탄은 자신에게 피해를 주지 않고, 척탄병의 수류탄은 더 좋지만 자신도 다친다. "
"척탄병은 의술과 기계에 큰 보너스를 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:360
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid ""
"Both classes also receive a poleaxe for when they are not tossing bombs."
msgstr "두 클래스 모두 폭탄을 던지지 않을 때 쓸 폴액스를 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "The bombard classes have MECH or MED as their most important stat."
msgstr "폭격 클래스는 기계나 의술이 가장 중요한 능력치다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:369
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "[Pick The Bombardier]"
msgstr "[폭격수 선택]"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "[Pick The Grenadier]"
msgstr "[척탄병 선택]"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df:502
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/rpgfare.df"
msgid "Oh hey, free items."
msgstr "오, 공짜 아이템이다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid " is raring to go!"
msgstr "은(는) 출발할 준비가 됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for "
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t이 사람 자리를 만들려면 누구를 뺄까: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Pick Your Jerks"
msgstr "얼간이 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid " is ready for a road trip!"
msgstr "은(는) 여행 갈 준비가 됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "You've recruited enough jerks! The car is full!"
msgstr "얼간이를 충분히 영입했다! 차가 꽉 찼다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
" claims to know you, but you swear you've never seen this person before..."
msgstr "는 너희를 안다고 주장하지만, 너희는 이 사람을 본 적이 없다고 맹세할 수 있다..."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "TRAIT: "
msgstr "특성: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "  PERK: "
msgstr "  특전: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "You can recruit "
msgstr "얼간이를 더 영입할 수 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid " more jerks!"
msgstr "명!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "일단 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid " for now"
msgstr "을(를) 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Recruit "
msgstr "영입: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
" senses a strange surge of happiness. Maybe things really will be okay; this"
" single thought gives them strength to carry on."
msgstr "은(는) 이상한 행복감이 솟구치는 걸 느낀다. 어쩌면 정말 괜찮아질지도. 이 생각 하나가 계속 나아갈 힘을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Bonus Morale!!!"
msgstr "보너스 사기!!!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:156
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "After all, why shouldn't I?"
msgstr "나라고 왜 안 되겠어?"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Watching the pure joy on that little face was enough to permanently change "
"the feelings of a team member. Who feels inspired by this small act?"
msgstr ""
"그 작은 얼굴에 떠오른 순수한 기쁨을 보는 것만으로도 일행 한 명의 마음이 영원히 바뀌었다. 이 작은 행동에 감동받은 사람은 누구일까?"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Unlocked: A variety of special traits!"
msgstr "해금: 다양한 특수 특성!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Unlocked: Max out a random stat!"
msgstr "해금: 무작위 능력치 하나 최대치!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: Endless happiness! This character will never enter despair again!"
msgstr "해금: 끝없는 행복! 이 캐릭터는 다시는 절망에 빠지지 않는다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:174
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Unlocked: Bodypumped! Your strength stat bonus has increased by 10!"
msgstr "해금: 근육 펌핑! 근력 능력치 보너스가 10 증가했다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: Elite! A sniper rifle has materialised in your trunk, and your max"
" shooting stat has increased by 3!"
msgstr "해금: 엘리트! 트렁크에 저격 소총이 나타났고, 최대 사격 능력치가 3 증가했다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:176
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: Steel Skin! Your vitality has substantially increased, up to a "
"maximum of 6!"
msgstr "해금: 강철 피부! 생명력이 크게 증가했다. 최대 6까지!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "VERY SPECIAL TRAIT COCKTAIL"
msgstr "아주 특별한 특성 칵테일"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "RANDOM STAT MASSIVE BONUS"
msgstr "무작위 능력치 대폭 보너스"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "NO MORE DESPAIR"
msgstr "더는 절망 없음"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "GIGA-BUFF"
msgstr "기가 근육"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "ELITE SNIPER"
msgstr "엘리트 저격수"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "SUPER STEEL SKIN"
msgstr "슈퍼 강철 피부"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "CRYSTAL SHIELD"
msgstr "크리스탈 방패"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "RIGHTEOUS SMITE"
msgstr "정의의 강타"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "HIGH CALIBRE ROUNDS"
msgstr "고구경 탄환"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "MELEE MINIGUN"
msgstr "근접 미니건"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "ECHO STRIKE"
msgstr "메아리 일격"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "SUPERCRITTER"
msgstr "슈퍼 크리터"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: Crystal Shield! The shield protects against zombie grapples. "
"Charge it by hitting stuff. Takes effect next mission."
msgstr "해금: 크리스탈 방패! 방패가 좀비의 붙잡기를 막아 준다. 뭔가를 때려서 충전한다. 다음 임무부터 적용."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: Righteous Smite! When at high morale, sometimes smite zombies on-"
"hit for bonus damage! Damage scales with weapon and STR."
msgstr "해금: 정의의 강타! 사기가 높을 때 가끔 좀비를 때리면 강타로 추가 피해를 준다! 피해는 무기와 근력에 비례."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: High Calibre Rounds! When firing single-shot firearms, your "
"bullets hit much harder!"
msgstr "해금: 고구경 탄환! 단발 총기를 쏠 때 총알이 훨씬 세게 맞는다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: Melee Minigun! HIT, HIT, HIT! Every hit reduces the cooldown of "
"the next."
msgstr "해금: 근접 미니건! 때려, 때려, 때려! 한 번 맞힐 때마다 다음 공격의 재사용 대기시간이 줄어든다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: Echo Strike! Melee swings send forth a short-lived projection, "
"which attacks again 0.5s later!"
msgstr "해금: 메아리 일격! 근접 공격을 휘두르면 잠깐 존재하는 환영이 나가 0.5초 뒤에 다시 공격한다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Unlocked: Supercrits! Supercrits activate 35% of the time whilst attacking "
"in melee."
msgstr "해금: 슈퍼 크리! 근접 공격 중 35% 확률로 슈퍼 치명타가 발동한다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''WOAOOAAHHHH? HNGGG??''"
msgstr "''우와아아아? 흐으읍??''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''WOWCHA''"
msgstr "''와우차''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''Oh hey this actually kinda cool.''"
msgstr "''오 이거 진짜 좀 멋진데.''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''GIVE ME BUR- oh okay I'll take this.''"
msgstr "''버거 내놔- 아 알았어 이거 받을게.''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''YOU CAN'T HAVE THIS SCEPTER COZ YOU'RE A DINKKK!!!''"
msgstr "''넌 얼간이라서 이 홀 못 가져가!!!''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''Now I can finally be like my favourite anime character!!!''"
msgstr "''이제 드디어 최애 애니 캐릭터처럼 될 수 있어!!!''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''Was I meant to swallow it whole?''"
msgstr "''이거 통째로 삼키는 거였어?''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''TAKEEEEE ONNNNNN MEEEEEEEE.''"
msgstr "''테이크 오오온 미이이이.''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''HNNNNGGGGGGGGGGG?''"
msgstr "''흐으으으으으읍?''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "''TRY THIS ONE FOR SIZE!''"
msgstr "''이건 어떠냐!''"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:236
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Make sure you pay attention next time! Scepter stacking is disabled."
msgstr "다음엔 잘 보고 고르라고! 홀 중첩은 꺼져 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
" touches the scepter's crystal, causing it to radiate a gentle blue light "
"before disappearing. They feel more powerful already."
msgstr "은(는) 홀의 크리스탈을 만진다. 크리스탈이 부드러운 푸른빛을 내뿜더니 사라진다. 벌써 힘이 세진 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Sycamore Scepter Powerup Unlocked!!!"
msgstr "시카모어 홀 강화 해금!!!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Sycamore Scepter already unlocked!"
msgstr "시카모어 홀은 이미 해금됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "OH GREAT, NOW WHAT SYCAMORE?"
msgstr "오 좋아, 이번엔 또 뭐야 시카모어?"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Against their better judgement, somebody touches the crystal. But who?"
msgstr "말리는 마음을 무릅쓰고, 누군가 크리스탈을 만진다. 그런데 누가?"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:266
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "FROM THIS SCEPTER YOU WILL RECIEVE..."
msgstr "이 홀에서 받게 될 것은..."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:267
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid " OR "
msgstr " 또는 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Characters with complex perks/traits - like KENSAI or CHAIRMASTER - receive "
msgstr "복잡한 특전/특성(KENSAI, CHAIRMASTER 등)을 가진 캐릭터는 이걸 받는다: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "RED"
msgstr "빨간색"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:269
#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid " pool upgrades."
msgstr " 풀 업그레이드."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"Characters with simpler perks/traits - like MEGABUFF or ATHLETE - receive "
msgstr "단순한 특전/특성(MEGABUFF, ATHLETE 등)을 가진 캐릭터는 이걸 받는다: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "BLUE"
msgstr "파란색"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Characters highlighted in "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "PURPLE"
msgstr "보라색"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid " already possess a scepter upgrade and will not benefit from another."
msgstr "(으)로 표시된 캐릭터는 이미 홀 업그레이드가 있어서 더 받아도 소용없다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:297
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"These magical scepters appear to have manifested out of nowhere. Already, "
"from the glow alone, it's clear that these are powerful objects. Perhaps "
"somebody should touch them."
msgstr "이 마법의 홀들은 난데없이 나타난 것 같다. 빛만 봐도 강력한 물건이라는 게 분명하다. 누군가 만져 봐야 하지 않을까."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Pick somebody to touch"
msgstr "만질 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Leave it be"
msgstr "그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid ""
"There's a strange scepter laying on the floor. It gets tossed in with the "
"other loot, for inspection afterwards."
msgstr "바닥에 이상한 홀이 놓여 있다. 나중에 살펴보려고 다른 물자와 함께 챙긴다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/scepter-range.df"
msgid "Make sure you pick your powerups before leaving."
msgstr "떠나기 전에 강화를 꼭 골라라."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid " smashes the prize machine open. "
msgstr "은(는) 뽑기 기계를 부숴 연다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid ""
" stuffs all the gumballs into a sack. They are technically food if you eat a"
" lot of them."
msgstr "는 껌볼을 전부 자루에 쓸어 담는다. 많이 먹으면 엄밀히 말해 식량이다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid ""
"The capsules contain rubber balls, tiny plastic novelty spiders, fake barf, "
"and so on. Nice!"
msgstr "캡슐 안에는 고무공, 작은 플라스틱 장난감 거미, 가짜 토사물 같은 게 들어 있다. 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid ""
"One of the figurines in the capsules was an ULTRA-RARE LIMITED EDITION! "
"Whoa! It's very inspiring."
msgstr "캡슐 속 피규어 하나가 초희귀 한정판이었다! 우와! 아주 고무적이다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid "The capsules are all full of MUTAGENIC OOZE that open and splatter on "
msgstr "캡슐마다 돌연변이 점액이 가득하다. 열리자마자 점액을 뒤집어쓰는 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid ""
"THIS OOZE IS A DISCONTINUED LIMITED EDITION! A COLLECTORS ITEM!!! WHOAAAAA!"
msgstr "이 점액은 단종된 한정판이다! 수집품이야!!! 우와아아아!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid " collects the candy in the machine. It's "
msgstr "은(는) 기계 안의 사탕을 챙긴다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid " favorite!"
msgstr " 최애 사탕이다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid " takes one of the toy guns, and immediately accidentally shoots "
msgstr "는 장난감 총 하나를 집더니 곧바로 실수로 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid ""
"self in the eye! Ouch!\r\n"
"\t\t\tAn important lesson about firearms is learned."
msgstr " 자신의 눈을 쏴 버린다! 아야!\r\n\t\t\t총기에 대한 중요한 교훈을 얻는다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid "Gachapon!"
msgstr "뽑기 기계!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid ""
" finds an unbroken prize machine. You'd use to put in a quarter and get "
"something. Now it's more convenient to just smash it."
msgstr "은(는) 멀쩡한 뽑기 기계를 발견한다. 예전엔 동전을 넣고 뭔가를 뽑았겠지만, 지금은 그냥 부수는 게 더 편하다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid "The machine is full of gumballs."
msgstr "기계 안에 껌볼이 가득하다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid "It contains little capsules full of cheap toys."
msgstr "싸구려 장난감이 든 작은 캡슐이 들어 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/region/swarmarcade.df"
msgid "The prizes are capsules with small figurines."
msgstr "경품은 작은 피규어가 든 캡슐이다."

