#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "There's just the slightest pang of guilt, but it passes."
msgstr "아주 살짝 죄책감이 들지만, 금방 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " feels like "
msgstr "은(는) 이 모든 게 "

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " is to blame for all of this."
msgstr "의 탓이라고 느낀다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "Hooray!"
msgstr "만세!"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "Victory! "
msgstr "승리! "

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " pats "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "self on the back."
msgstr " 자신의 등을 토닥인다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:22
