#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "Nice one!"
msgstr "잘했어!"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " shakes "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " head at "
msgstr " 고개를 젓는다. 한심한 건 "

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "self."
msgstr " 자신이다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " gives "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " the stink eye."
msgstr "을(를) 째려본다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "There's no one around to carry on the dream of Canada."
msgstr "캐나다의 꿈을 이어 갈 사람이 아무도 없다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " is deeply affected by "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "'s death."
msgstr "의 죽음에 깊은 충격을 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "There will be more hot dog eating contests in the future."
msgstr "앞으로도 핫도그 먹기 대회는 또 있을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "This could have been prevented!"
msgstr "이건 막을 수 있었는데!"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "Well, life goes on"
msgstr "뭐, 삶은 계속되지"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:135
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " explodes in a pulpy mess!"
msgstr "은(는) 펑 터져 곤죽이 된다!"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "Dang it"
msgstr "젠장"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " eats another 100 hot dogs!"
msgstr "은(는) 핫도그 100개를 더 먹는다!"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:144
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid ": Wooooo!"
msgstr ": 우우우우!"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " gets to 99 hot dogs and then literally, not figuratively, chokes."
msgstr "은(는) 핫도그 99개째에서 비유가 아니라 진짜로 목이 막힌다."

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid ": Wait I can do this!"
msgstr ": 잠깐 나 할 수 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid "There's a hotdog eating competition! Yee-haw!"
msgstr "핫도그 먹기 대회다! 이햐!"

#: deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/moments/moment-example.df"
msgid " eats 100 hot dogs"
msgstr "이(가) 핫도그 100개 먹기"

